# DNA Methylation-Based Cancer Diagnostics: Company Landscape

> Regulatory status as of early 2026. LDT = laboratory-developed test (CLIA-certified lab, not FDA-cleared).  
> **Genomic scope**: WG = whole-genome; Large panel = tens of thousands to hundreds of thousands of CpG sites (targeted enrichment); Small panel = tens to low hundreds of loci/regions.  
> **Detection chemistry**: BS-seq = bisulfite sequencing (sodium bisulfite conversion + NGS); MS-PCR = methylation-specific PCR (bisulfite conversion + allele-specific primers); qPCR-BS = bisulfite conversion + quantitative PCR; MeDIP = methylated DNA immunoprecipitation; cfMeDIP = cell-free MeDIP.

